Yes, Atlas detects most duplicate charges within 24 hours and refunds them automatically, and
Support also refunds the duplicate as soon as it is reported [1], [2]. The refund returns the
money to your original payment method [2]. Refunds to cards appear on your card statement within 5
to 10 business days, while refunds of direct debits take up to 3 business days [1], [2].
